{% slide
   title="GAME: We're meeting for drinks at 7 pm"
   align="center"
   hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
- We are in a small town.
- Today, we are all meeting at 7:00 pm.
- The bar is our destination.
- Each of us is in a different place in the town: at the train station, at home, at the supermarket.
- Something can go wrong during the journey...
{% /column %}

{% column %}
![slide_5_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-1/slide_5_Freeform_6.png)

![slide_5_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-1/slide_5_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Game rules" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
- One person at a time picks a **problem card**.
- Choose a **solution** based on personal experience: ask someone, use an app, call a friend, I don't know...
- Then you **move your figure** on the map and continue your journey to the bar.
- Then it is the next person's turn.
- The goal is for **everyone to get to the bar**.
{% /column %}

